WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Can you do it without fermentation?

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:14,120
Don't disturb me while I'm in treatment

3
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:18,040
Number 1, let him go

4
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,440
Let him come with us

5
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:24,150
I am the one who heals him and protects him

6
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:26,930
It was you who almost killed him

7
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,220
Why do you want him to go with you?

8
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:31,620
Because you are a zombie, you are a monster

9
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,920
Humanity is destined to destroy you, right?

10
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:35,880
I'm no longer human

11
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:38,680
Why try to live in peace with humans?

12
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:40,080
Obviously just resisting

13
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:41,980
He's obviously very merciful

14
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:44,380
Why do humans just refuse to give up on destroying me?
